CHAPTER.VERS:
If thy brother, the son of thy mother, or thy son, or thy daughter, or the wife of thy bosom, or thy friend, who  as thy own soul, shall entice thee secretly, saying, Let us go and serve 
        other 
        gods, which thou hast not known, thou, nor thy fathers;

And there shall cleave 
        nothing of the cursed thing to thy hand: that the LORD may turn from the fierceness of his anger, and show thee mercy, and have compassion upon thee, and multiply thee, as he hath sworn to thy fathers; 

          cursed: or, devoted
